#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SD1349 expect=noViolation domain=DM
#note "Boundary: one record leaves STUDYID empty while the others agree. An empty STUDYID is not a competing study identifier, so this rule reports nothing (the unpopulated required variable is a separate rule's concern)."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset DM class="SPECIAL PURPOSE" label="Demographics"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col SUBJID  type=Char label="Subject Identifier for the Study"
col SEX     type=Char label="Sex"
---
STUDY-A | DM | STUDY-A-001 | 001 | M
STUDY-A | DM | STUDY-A-002 | 002 | F
        | DM | STUDY-A-003 | 003 | M
